
---
import "../../styles/global.css";

const technologies = [
  "Astro",
  "Tailwind CSS",
  "Git",
  "GitHub",
  "Vercel",
  "Cloudflare DNS",
];
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Technical case study of Elijah Davids' Astro portfolio and deployment workflow."
    />
    <title>Portfolio Case Study | Elijah Davids</title>
  </head>

  <body class="min-h-screen bg-[#0B1020] text-slate-100">
    <main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16">
      <a href="/#projects" class="text-sky-400 hover:underline">
        ← Back to Projects
      </a>

      <p class="mt-16 font-mono text-sm text-sky-400">
        PROJECT 001 / WEB DEVELOPMENT & DEPLOYMENT
      </p>

      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold md:text-6xl">
        Personal Portfolio &
        <span class="text-sky-400">Deployment Pipeline.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-400">
        Designing, building, and deploying a professional
        portfolio using modern web technologies and
        automated deployment workflows.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {technologies.map((tech) => (
          <span class="rounded-md bg-sky-400/10 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-sky-300">
            {tech}
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/Ejahmix/cloud-portfolio"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="rounded-lg bg-sky-400 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-950"
        >
          View Source Code ↗
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-20 space-y-16">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">01. The Challenge</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-400">
            I wanted a professional online presence that could
            evolve beyond a traditional résumé into a platform
            for showcasing independent technical projects.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">02. The Solution</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-400">
            I built a responsive static website using Astro and
            Tailwind CSS, then connected the source repository
            to Vercel for automated production deployments.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">03. Architecture</h2>
          <div class="mt-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-[#111B30] p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-sm leading-9 text-sky-300">
              VS Code → GitHub → Vercel → Website Visitors
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400">
              Cloudflare manages DNS for the custom domain.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">04. What I Learned</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-400">
            This project gave me hands-on experience with Git,
            repository management, automated deployments,
            domain configuration, and troubleshooting a
            local development environment.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">05. Next Steps</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-400">
            My next objective is to explore AWS hosting using
            Amazon S3, CloudFront, IAM, and GitHub Actions.
            This will allow me to expand the project into
            cloud infrastructure and deployment automation.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
